      "summary_en": "Kog'Maw fires an artillery shell at a great distance dealing magic damage (increased significantly on low health enemies) and revealing non-stealthed targets. Additionally, multiple Living Artilleries in a short period of time cause them to cost additional Mana.",
      "summary_zh": "克格莫发射一枚射程极远的活体炮弹，让被命中的敌人暴露在己方视野中，并对目标造成魔法伤害（对低血量目标的伤害会显著提升）。 在短时间内连续使用活体大炮，将消耗额外的法力值。",
